data: {"type":"response.output_item.done","item":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"toolu_bdrk_01SBr7XFYeygiyUjHoivhviE","output":"   101\t\n   102\t**Special case — Sector FS (Financial Services):**\n   103\tUses GSO mapping → FI, Finance companies, Insurance, Securities, Funds, SBV, Public Sector, Others\n   104\t\n   105\t#### SME:\n   106\t```\n   107\tPersona = \"{Eco Activity}\" - \"{IMEX}\" – \"{B2B-B2C}\"\n   108\t```\n   109\t\n   110\t**16 SME personas:**\n   111\t\n   112\t| Eco Activity | IMEX | B2B/B2C |\n   113\t| --- | --- | --- |\n   114\t| Manufacturing | Domestic/Export/Import | B2B |\n   115\t| Retail | Domestic/Export/Import | B2C |\n   116\t| Service | Domestic/Export/Import | B2B or B2C |\n   117\t| Wholesale | Domestic/Export/Import | B2B |\n   118\t| Other | — | — |\n   119\t\n   120\t*If any of the 3 components (Eco Activity, IMEX, B2B-B2C) is missing → Persona defaults to \"Other\"*\n   121\t\n   122\t### 7. Customer Archetypes\n   123\t\n   124\tBehavioral archetypes (binary flags, not mutually exclusive):\n   125\t\n   126\t| Archetype | Description |\n   127\t| --- | --- |\n   128\t| **Bidding for Growth** | Actively pursuing opportunities through bidding for contracts/projects |\n   129\t| **Cash Rich** | Significant cash reserves and strong cash flow; prioritize liquidity |\n   130\t| **Transaction Heavy** | High volume of financial transactions; need efficient processing |\n   131\t| **Credit Seeker** | Actively seeking credit/loans for expansion or new projects |\n   132\t| **Working Capital** | Need short-term financing to support daily operations and cash flow |\n   133\t| **MLT Capital Seeker** | Need medium/long-term credit for expansion + short-term working capital |\n   134\t\n   135\t### 8. Active Customer Definition\n   136\t\n   137\tA customer is **Active** if they have interaction with CIBG products within the measurement window:\n   138\t\n   139\t| Flag | Window | Logic |\n   140\t| --- | --- | --- |\n   141\t| `active_3m` | 3 months | Primary active definition |\n   142\t| `active_1m` | 1 month | Short-term activity |\n   143\t| `active_12m` | 12 months | `active_3m = 1` at any point in last 12M |\n   144\t| `continuously_active` | YTD | Active every month from Dec prior year to reporting month |\n   145\t\n   146\t**Activity criteria by product:**\n   147\t\n   148\t| Product | Activity Indicator |\n   149\t| --- | --- |\n   150\t| Cash In/Out | Specific TranscodeIDs (1, 4, 11, 16, 29, 52, 61, 86, 201, 208, etc.) |\n   151\t| Tax, H2H, FEB | Transaction in window |\n   152\t| Cash Collection | NFI in window |\n   153\t| FX | VOL or NFX in window |\n   154\t| Lending, TD, CD | AVG Bal in window |\n   155\t| LC, LG, Trade Collection | VOL or AVG BAL or NFI in window |\n   156\t| Factoring | VOL or NFI in window |\n   157\t| Banca | APE or NFI in window |\n   158\t| Debit Card | Purchase/Withdraw transaction in window |\n   159\t\n   160\t### 9. Customer Status Flags\n   161\t\n   162\t| Flag | Definition |\n   163\t| --- | --- |\n   164\t| **New Acquire** | Opened CIF in current fiscal year |\n   165\t| **New Reactive** | Was inactive (active_3M=0) at Dec prior year, now active |\n   166\t| **New customer** (`custype`) | Either New_Acquire=1 OR New_Reactive=1 |\n   167\t| **Churn** | Was active at Dec prior year (active_3M=1), now inactive |\n   168\t| **Credit customer** | Has Bal of Lending/LC/Guarantee or Limit in last 12M |\n   169\t| **Core flag** | TOI Annualised ≥ 0.2 bn VND |\n   170\t| **Focus** | Customer priority: Focus / Maintain / Others |\n   171\t| **MOA** | Main Operating Account (tagged by DA) |\n   172\t\n   173\t### 10. B2B / B2C Classification\n   174\t\n   175\tMapped by GSO code (from DA):\n   176\t- **B2B**: Business sells to other businesses\n   177\t- **B2C**: Business sells directly to end consumers\n   178\t- **Others**: Unclassified\n   179\t\n   180\t## See Also","duration_ms":0}}

